Um, at least if you can see the critter fall in, the trap will be
"discovered" for you.  Ditto for other types of traps.  The problem
is that the program will only show the % symbol (or * if it's a
falling rock trap) and unless you are really careful, it's very easy
to be tempted to walk into that square and examine.  (You'll see the ^
symbol appear after the monster rots away in the pit.)

The way nethack is designed, i.e., one symbol displayed per square, I
guess this is an inevitable "feature"....

